<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath Bank dips on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Sampath Bank dips on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sampath Bank Ltd fell 2.5 percent or 1.50 rupees to 58.50 in early profit-taking on Thursday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Since the share rose to 60 rupees from around 56 rupees in under a week, profit-taking was bound to set in,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>The blue chip Sampath Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
